{"version":1,"key":"card:762","content":{"id":762,"content":[{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"5844bd70-14f4-464f-ab18-0d539365ac3b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0fecd75d-2958-4451-8e1e-158492084b56","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b20d321b-bb14-42cf-bd13-8574152e9dda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基于开源模型训练还是基于已有的顶尖模型"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c2fb8134-1f03-4dea-8db1-d3320f1f8608","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自己锻炼模型的反馈周期长，训练到一半新出现的模型就使得这一切没有意义，Mannus 的选择是基于顶尖的模型做 Agent，如果模型的进步是上涨的潮水，那么 Mannus 就是那条船"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"593b2b79-58b9-4823-86b0-ec32eb789958","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2e8b9418-fc1e-4afe-b09a-9da338b0d8ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"围绕着 KV 缓存设计"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a048373f-2664-4384-9c69-49a86bd2547e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"命中缓存和非缓存的价格是十倍，目前的 KV 缓存都是基于前缀，要保持前缀稳定，只添加上下文，不要修改或者移除上下文的内容，即使是单个标记的差异都会使得缓存失效"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3e1df4d7-58dd-48bf-8c7b-eab1098752b9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b96bb6b0-6629-4cc0-8424-e6fb29d75b28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不使用动态的行动空间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fda2dad0-9c44-45b1-90af-9380649f8c9c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随着代理能力增强，覆盖的职责更多，工具会爆炸性的增长，特别是 MCP 的出现，用户可以添加自定义工具，更是使得模型的行动空间更大，模型在如此大的行动空间可能会选择错误的工具执行，反而变得愚蠢，这种情况下一个自然的想法是动态的加载工具"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf96747b-e773-436d-9739-13b191e4930f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但动态增删工具，会使得缓存失效，因为工具的定义一般都会在序列化后放在上下文的前部；另外动态增删工具会以模型在后续看到对已经不存在的工具的引用，模型会感到困惑，会导致幻觉动作"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5a59b0f4-ad17-4cb0-9b5e-ebd0fc3c4810","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不动态增删工具，而是遮蔽一些工具，大部分模型厂商会提供响应预填充，在不修改模型定义的情况下约束模型的行动空间，比如调用浏览器相关的工具，提前预填充 broswer_，模型就只能将执行 browser_ 相关的工具，模型在更小的行动空间更容易找到需要执行的动作"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"58e6f274-26e5-414d-be04-4c83c7266d62","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aa5b0fe6-405f-4347-b462-87032c42ca36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用文件系统作为作为上下文"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03fd5aa9-ebe2-4dfc-bd85-4f3cfda87911","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在实际的场景中，工具的执行结果可能十分大，会撑爆模型的上下文，输入的上下文过大也会使得成本变高，将结果存储在文件系统中，没有大小限制，模型使用检索工具按需读取和写入文件，并且具有持久化的效果，可作为外部记忆，在跨 session 共享工作内容，跨时间共享工作进度"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cb87639f-d917-44c0-aa11-b1a22f63b7d1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b597217f-9839-4d0f-b66a-bed8be78d57f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 TODO.md 来复述注意力"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2144549-48d3-4315-9a7e-4027d3fe5504","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模型每次在处理复杂任务时，都会创建一个 TODO.md 文件，记录待办步骤，在执行的过程中不断读取和更新，这个过程其实是在操控注意力，每次都把 TODO.md 放入到上下文的末尾，使得模型不会忘记最初的目标，这种一种操控注意力的手段"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"768968c8-0615-4560-a341-aff7f564c164","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ca925746-1b20-4f3b-999a-bceab4f23905","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保留错误"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f9c4fc6-9f4e-44d9-abb2-fc9c7b1665c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在实际执行任务的过程中，遇到错误是很正常的事情，原因多种多样，可能是模型幻觉，也可能是参数错误，这个错误不应该被剔除然后进行重试，错误应当成为循环的一部分作为反馈给模型，模型通过错误了解执行环境的行为以做出调整，擦除错误会使得模型无法适应，始终犯同样的错误"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"13b86571-30a3-441c-b4e9-f1effc0ada66","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b9f3197-215d-4300-90d3-b715ac4c02d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多样本学习"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24406b95-d82e-40af-9cd3-3f8f391f0d81","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过给模型提供少量样本可以提高模型的正确率，但是也可能使得模型的泛化能力减弱，模型的模仿能力很强，可能会导致使用使用重复的决策去解决问题，这种情况下，我们需要提供多样性，不同的数据格式，不同的顺序，加入一些随机性，不要让模型产生路径依赖"}]}]}]}],"tags":["AI/Agent"],"createTime":1781364295221,"updateTime":1781364319229,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1781364319229}}